{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;I can't wake up... I can't wake up... I can't wake up...&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The nightmare that never allows waking lasts forever.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up from bed and a girl appears before you. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She calls herself \u201cEntourfe,\u201d a management support android. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The setting is a strange facility, and you will explore the inside of the strange facility with her. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The nightmare lingers. It will drag you to hell itself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>The protagonist, plagued by nightmares<br>He is invited to an underground facility.<br><br>It is a nightmarish place filled with monsters, androids, and members of a bizarre organization.<br><br>Can he overcome the nightmare and escape from it?  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Conundrum: Propositions are presented in sections.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150710/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-02-25_050749.png?t=1741212363\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tentative answers and answers to the propositions are obtained according to the clarity Level of the search.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150710/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-02-25_105044.png?t=1741212363\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a text-based adventure game that switches between point-and-click explorat